      "body": "> \ud83e\udd16 **SPARQ agent** \u2014 auto-filed by the nightly differential-fuzz lane (bead sq-0iqzw). [FABLE-5]\n\nThe nightly sparq-vs-Oxigraph differential fuzzer found **12 non-adjudicated mismatch(es)** in shard `update-advancing` (category `update`, mode `baseline`, seed window 4132800000+150000).\n\n- **Failing seeds:** 4132943222, 4132943257, 4132943260, 4132943261, 4132943276, 4132943281, 4132943287, 4132943295, 4132943305, 4132943317, 4132943321, 4132943322\n- **Deterministic replay:** `cargo run -p sparq-bench --release -- fuzz 4132943222 1 update`\n- **Run:** https://github.com/sparq-org/sparq/actions/runs/30522408864\n- **Bead:** `sq-dfmgeal` (P1, auto-appended; push best-effort)\n- **Artifact:** `differential-repro-update-advancing` on the run above (full log)\n\nThe adjudicated divergence classes in `bench/differential-divergences.json` (sq-eibog cross-family `=`/`!=`; sq-ai2wa bnode-vs-IRI) are already excluded by the comparator, so this is a candidate **wrong-answer bug** \u2014 in sparq or (less likely) Oxigraph \u2014 until adjudicated.\n\n### First failing case (seed + query + graph)\n\n```\nseed=4132943222\nstep=7 of 10\nop: INSERT { <http://ex/s2> <http://ex/p2> <http://ex/o2> } WHERE { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> 16 . }\ncanonical dataset differs (sparq(rebuild) vs oxigraph)\nonly in sparq(rebuild):\n  <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> \"016\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\nonly in oxigraph:\n  <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> \"16\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n  <http://ex/s2> <http://ex/p2> <http://ex/o2> .\n\nrepro: cargo run -p sparq-bench --release -- update-fuzz --seed-start 4132943222 --seed-count 1\n--- full sequence ---\n[0] DELETE DATA { <http://ex/s0> <http://ex/p2> \"lit1\" . GRAPH <http://ex/g0> { <http://ex/s0> <http://ex/p0> 14 . } <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p3> \"lit4\" . <http://ex/s5> <http://ex/p2> \"lit1\" . <http://ex/s5> <http://ex/p1> <http://ex/o4> . }\n[1] DELETE DATA { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> \"lit3\" . <http://ex/s0> <http://ex/p1> <<( <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> 11 )>> . }\n[2] INSERT DATA { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> <http://ex/o3> . GRAPH <http://ex/g0> { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> \"lit4\" . } GRAPH <http://ex/g1> { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p2> \"lit3\" . } <http://ex/s4> <http://ex/p3> <<( <http://ex/s3> <http://ex/p2> 19 )>> . }\n[3] DELETE WHERE { ?s <http://ex/p2> ?o }\n[4] INSERT DATA { <http://ex/s0> <http://ex/p1> \"lit0\" . <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> \"016\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> . <http://ex/s2> <http://ex/p3> <<( <http://ex/s0> <http://ex/p0> 8 )>> . }\n[5] MOVE SILENT GRAPH <http://ex/g2> TO GRAPH <http://ex/g2>\n[6] WITH <http://ex/g2> DELETE { ?s <http://ex/p2> ?o } INSERT { ?s <http://ex/p3> ?o } WHERE { ?s <http://ex/p2> ?o }\n[7] INSERT { <http://ex/s2> <http://ex/p2> <http://ex/o2> } WHERE { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p1> 16 . }\n[8] INSERT { <http://ex/s2> <http://ex/p0> \"+17\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> } WHERE { GRAPH <http://ex/g1> { <http://ex/s1> <http://ex/p2> \"lit3\" . } }\n[9] INSERT { ?s ?p ?o } WHERE { GRAPH <http://ex/g1> { ?s ?p ?o } }\n```\n",
